ssword entry, so nobody has any rights left and every request to\nthe web UI and the API is refused. This happens with both web UIs and\nwith direct API calls. Only the superuser account, --noacl or editing\nthe configuration files gets the admin back in.\n\nRemove the default access entry only when the wizard admin has\ncredentials, which means an admin without a username (a \"*\" entry) or\na named admin with an enabled password entry that has a password.\nOtherwise keep the entry and log a warning. The Finished page then\nshows the text that does not say that the entry will be removed. The\ncheck looks at the configured credentials only, not at the allowed\nnetwork.\n\nSigned-off-by: Josef Schlehofer <pepe.schlehofer@gmail.com>","upstream_url":"https://github.com/tvheadend/tvheadend/commit/443f15ba063d95a1f4a3b74978c07d9d0a5ae9c5"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/config","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true"],"exposed_ports":["9981/tcp","9982/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":true,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/tvheadend/builds/443f15ba-ls2.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/tvheadend/builds/443f15ba-ls2/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/tvheadend/builds/443f15ba-ls2/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/tvheadend/builds/443f15ba-ls2/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/tvheadend/builds/443f15ba-ls2/packages.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/tvheadend/builds/443f15ba-ls2/packages.arm64.json"},"release":"htt